WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.449 --> 00:00:01.849
You set the plan.

2
00:00:01.894 --> 00:00:07.084
DepthPilot runs the steps, explains its decisions, and keeps the receipts.

3
00:00:07.129 --> 00:00:11.468
A local trading bot for dreamDEX perpetuals on Tokyo testnet.

4
00:00:12.549 --> 00:00:15.124
Start with the public reference dashboard.

5
00:00:15.169 --> 00:00:19.783
See the current decision, recorded transactions, and resulting exposure.

6
00:00:19.828 --> 00:00:22.143
Snapshots update periodically.

7
00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:26.427
This reference operator is a separate deployment from the app you download.

8
00:00:27.516 --> 00:00:32.000
Download the Windows package, or use the hash checked PowerShell installer.

9
00:00:32.045 --> 00:00:35.005
Open DepthPilot launches your local dashboard.

10
00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:38.669
The bundled runtime avoids a separate Node installation, and the console

11
00:00:38.714 --> 00:00:39.969
stays hidden.

12
00:00:41.049 --> 00:00:44.329
The app creates a separate bot address on your computer.

13
00:00:44.374 --> 00:00:48.023
Use Link a Bot on dreamDEX to grant Perps access, then enter your

14
00:00:48.068 --> 00:00:49.518
trading account.

15
00:00:49.563 --> 00:00:52.602
Your main wallet's private key is never an input.

16
00:00:53.683 --> 00:00:56.532
Explore live market depth before you trade.

17
00:00:56.577 --> 00:01:00.112
Check spread, minimum size, and data freshness.

18
00:01:00.157 --> 00:01:03.346
The planner uses visible liquidity and your price rules to size the

19
00:01:03.391 --> 00:01:04.691
next order.

20
00:01:05.783 --> 00:01:09.817
Choose a round plan, quantity, timing, and cumulative trading and fee

21
00:01:09.862 --> 00:01:10.967
limits.

22
00:01:11.012 --> 00:01:12.912
Review before activation.

23
00:01:12.957 --> 00:01:16.231
Round plans attempt to open and close their own exposure.

24
00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:19.225
Target plans retain their resulting position.

25
00:01:20.316 --> 00:01:23.616
Activity explains the next step in plain language.

26
00:01:23.661 --> 00:01:27.315
In this simulated example, the spread exceeds the reviewed rule, so

27
00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:28.700
the bot waits.

28
00:01:28.745 --> 00:01:32.679
Recorded values appear beside the limit, with observation age and remaining

29
00:01:32.724 --> 00:01:34.454
fee reservations.

30
00:01:35.549 --> 00:01:39.189
The reference bot selects entries, waits through its holding interval,

31
00:01:39.234 --> 00:01:41.483
and attempts the close by itself.

32
00:01:41.528 --> 00:01:45.572
This recorded round bought and sold zero point zero zero four ether.

33
00:01:45.617 --> 00:01:49.007
Both receipts were independently verified on Tokyo.

34
00:01:50.149 --> 00:01:53.279
Follow the transaction hash to the public explorer.

35
00:01:53.324 --> 00:01:55.884
A submitted order is not a confirmed fill.

36
00:01:55.929 --> 00:01:59.663
DepthPilot counts the actual quantities in its checked receipts, and

37
00:01:59.708 --> 00:02:02.602
preserves unresolved or partial results.

38
00:02:03.683 --> 00:02:07.077
If something needs attention, choose Check current state.

39
00:02:07.122 --> 00:02:12.631
Inspect permissions, exposure, open orders, gas, and pending transactions.

40
00:02:12.676 --> 00:02:16.306
The check does not sign, resend, or restart a plan.

41
00:02:16.351 --> 00:02:18.600
Here, the account is flat.

42
00:02:19.683 --> 00:02:23.812
History keeps recorded fills, fees, and receipt links.

43
00:02:23.857 --> 00:02:27.841
Export a readable report, or reuse settings for another plan.

44
00:02:27.886 --> 00:02:31.900
Reuse creates a new draft, without carrying trading permission.

45
00:02:31.945 --> 00:02:35.560
This screen displays a completed, historical session.

46
00:02:36.683 --> 00:02:40.752
The official dreamDEX Markets SDK powers market and account reads,

47
00:02:40.797 --> 00:02:43.686
order construction, and receipt decoding.

48
00:02:43.731 --> 00:02:47.696
DepthPilot adds depth aware planning, durable execution state, and

49
00:02:47.741 --> 00:02:50.915
a dashboard that makes those decisions understandable.

50
00:02:52.016 --> 00:02:53.701
Watch the reference run.

51
00:02:53.746 --> 00:02:57.185
Download DepthPilot, and run your own reviewed plan.

52
00:02:57.230 --> 00:02:59.560
Keep your computer awake and online.

53
00:02:59.605 --> 00:03:01.539
This is a Tokyo testnet MVP.

54
00:03:01.584 --> 00:03:05.139
Transaction counts and equity are not profit claims.
